+# Project Specification: Pulseboard
+
+**Project ID**: 001-pulseboard  
+**Created**: 2026-08-10  
+**Status**: Specification draft  
+**Scale**: Level 2 — moderate pilot product  
+**Recipe**: None — the brief establishes a web product but no technology stack; stack selection is deferred to technical assessment.
+
+*[as of SHA ba322c6 | verified 2026-08-10 | Speck 10.5.0]*
+
+---
+
+## 📊 Information Sources
+
+**Traceability**: This greenfield specification derives solely from `brief.md`.
+
