+
+| Role | Name/Team | Interest | Influence |
+|------|-----------|----------|-----------|
+| Pilot users | Five pilot teams and their facilitators | Reliable meeting follow-through | High |
+| Action recipients | Team members assigned confirmed actions | Clear, legitimate commitments | High |
+| Product owner | [NEEDS CLARIFICATION] | Pilot outcome and scope decisions | High |
+
+### Communication Plan
+
+- **Updates**: review pilot metrics during the four-week pilot.
+- **Reviews**: confirm the reminder-channel decision before delivery work begins.
+- **Escalation**: a facilitator raises unsafe extraction or scheduling behavior to the product owner.
